        "Description": "Hello 47.\r\rYour target is Altaaf Karim. He’s attending a event in Dubai tonight, and our client wants him eliminated. Unfortunately, there’s a complication. Two other agents, Trent Holmes and Elton Hambledon, have also been sent after Karim. Neither knows about the other, and neither knows that you’re there. Keep your cover, eliminate Karim, and deal with the competition however you see fit. \r\rGood luck, 47.",
